<tr><td class="bl-pad" style="padding:28px 32px 28px 32px;background:#ffffff;"><h2 style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:normal;color:#1f2937;">A note</h2><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%"><tr><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#1f2937;">Dear readers,<br>thank you for a great year &amp; a busy autumn.</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#1f2937;">We met 2 * 3 * 4 times (that is 24) at Sam&#39;s, and &quot;the_big_room&quot; was full.<br>Tickets &lt; $10 &amp; children &gt; 5 go free; ask file_name owners at snake_case@example.test.</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#1f2937;">An indented line stays as it was.   <br>  So does this one.</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#1f2937;">The last paragraph, after many blank lines.</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#1f2937;font-style:italic;">Robin, editor</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
